000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. COPYTEST.
000300* Library module: COPY in the DATA and PROCEDURE DIVISIONs, with
000400* REPLACING by pseudo-text and by a word, and a copybook found
000500* beside the program. All host side: the assembler never sees
000600* anything but the copied text.
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000900 COPY CPYWS.
001000 01  IN-REC.
001100     COPY CPYREC REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
001200 01  OUT-REC.
001300     COPY CPYREC REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==OUT==.
001400 01  TOTAL        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
001500 01  E-TOTAL      PIC ZZZZ9.99.
001600 01  E-AMT        PIC ZZ9.99.
001700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001800 MAIN.
001900     MOVE 7 TO IN-ID. MOVE 'ALPHA' TO IN-NAME.
002000     MOVE 12.50 TO IN-AMT.
002100     MOVE IN-ID TO OUT-ID. MOVE IN-NAME TO OUT-NAME.
002200     MOVE IN-AMT TO OUT-AMT.
002300     MOVE OUT-AMT TO E-AMT.
002400     DISPLAY '[' OUT-ID '][' OUT-NAME '][' E-AMT ']'.
002500     MOVE 0 TO TOTAL.
002600     COPY CPYPROC REPLACING AMOUNT BY IN-AMT.
002700     COPY CPYPROC REPLACING AMOUNT BY OUT-AMT
002800         TOTAL BY CW-COUNTER.
002900     MOVE TOTAL TO E-TOTAL.
003000     DISPLAY 'TOTAL ' E-TOTAL ' COUNTER ' CW-COUNTER ' ' CW-FLAG.
003100     STOP RUN.
